WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:12.570
I don't really get it, but some
monster exploded on the road.

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:14.700
He slammed right into
this other golden thing.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:18.700
I'm telling you this isn't a prank!

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:21.080
Why would I call you this
early in the morning to do that?!

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:22.000
You an idiot?!

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.350
And that golden thing...

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:33.550
Huh? What'd it look like?

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:36.260
Well, I've never seen
anything like it before...

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:38.600
Whoa! It's starting to rain.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:39.890
Crap. Crap. Crap!

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:45.270
Why does he always make
things so troublesome?

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.430
And... What was I talkin' about?

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:51.900
Huh? I said something like that?

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:55.340
Sorry. I'm gonna hang up for now.

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:57.020
Really. Sorry.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.790
I guess I really need to take a vacation...

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:13.800
No mistake. That was definitely Luke.

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:43.990
<i>The monochromatic empty eyes</i>
<i>of</i> <i>sapiens</i> <i>floating</i> <i>within the unreality</i>

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:49.380
<i>Completely peerless flowing</i> <i>blood,</i>
<i>controlled</i> <i>and digitized</i>

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:52.460
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:53.630
<i>Can you see?</i>

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:55.800
<i>(BOOING BOOING) Hellacious</i>

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:57.170
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:58.840
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:01:58.840 --> 00:01:59.890
<i>I can see!</i>

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:01.890
<i>The timing of the programming</i>

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:02.760
<i>Yea, gotcha!</i>

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:06.480
<i>I want to be eroded away (brain wash)</i>

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:08.640
<i>Up the blast! </i>

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:12.690
<i>Ah, this dying world </i>

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:19.200
<i>Run like you're piercing through it</i>

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:25.540
<i>The rising flames burn everything away </i>

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:30.210
<i>Your resolve and your love</i>

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:33.790
<i>From darkness to the light</i>

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:03.200
Why are you in a picture with my friend?!

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.830
Stupid! It's nothing like that!

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:08.910
Really? Then hurry up
and show me your phone!

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:11.120
There's something called personal privacy!

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:11.790
Huh?

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:17.050
Ouch! Don't joke with me, trash!

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:22.220
What's up with you? Wanna die?

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:30.850
Give us some money.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:34.190
Here, take it and go!

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.690
Ow! Ow!

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:40.900
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.030
My stomach hurts!

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.610
--Hey, Bro! Bro!
--My stomach really hurts!

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:45.120
--This is bad! This is bad!
--My stomach hurts! Gah! It really hurts!

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:49.620
--If we don't get enough money,
my sick friend is gonna die...

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:52.750
What's wrong?

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.130
You found me already.

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:00.940
Yo.

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:06.850
Are you stupid or is it that
you just don't bother thinking?

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:09.100
--Well, of course--
--I think it's both.

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:10.100
He didn't ask you.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.060
I agree.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:17.730
We should move as quietly
as possible. Am I wrong?

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:20.990
What happened yesterday
was the enemy's fault.

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:23.400
You should have taken care
of things before that happened.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:27.410
I was taking care of a person at the
same time! It was a little girl to boot!

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.660
You're an idiot, after all.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.700
You had a person with you? Why?

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.420
Did the enemy have a hostage?

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:40.840
No, well. So there were
these circumstances...

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.420
We shouldn't involve
ourselves with people.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.150
Sorry, but that's not how I think.

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:51.520
Someone who doesn't understand
people wouldn't be able to save one.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:52.900
Am I wrong?

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:57.100
The way you do things.
How do I put this?

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:59.610
It doesn't have heart.

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.610
Welcome! What would you like to order?

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:14.040
Your method just looks
like self-satisfaction to me.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.690
I heard. Looks like nothing was wrong.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:25.920
Yes.

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:29.140
It looks like a sister will
come to pick you up soon.

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:31.640
Was she mad?

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:34.480
I don't know about that.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:36.550
What? Is she a scary person?

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.040
She's usually really nice.

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:42.780
Hey, Sophie. You really can't remember?

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:45.070
What happened that night.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:53.540
I'll tell you if I remember.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.830
Sorry for trying to push you.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:57.710
Yes.

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:00.670
Her guardian has arrived.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.200
Was she mad?

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:17.560
I'm sorry.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:20.520
But I really have to find a certain person.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:24.070
I'll be back before dinner.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:27.960
I might be able to find
out about my brother.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:31.500
If you don't come back
by dinner tonight...

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:33.660
You know what will happen, right?

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.330
Y-Yes!

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:39.080
It can't be helped. I'll allow it this time.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:40.350
Y-Yes...

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.840
Thank you very much.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:46.590
--Thank you very much!
--Grandpa, she's not talking to you.

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:52.550
Thank you, Sister!
I'll definitely keep my promise!

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:03.600
Are you all right?

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:07.280
That was dangerous!
Watch where you're going!

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.320
Hardy.

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:12.320
Sorry.

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:15.540
No, it was my fault.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:17.330
Are you hurt?

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:18.580
Looks like I'm okay.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:19.540
Thank goodness.

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.290
Just hurry up and go.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:23.880
But...

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:26.500
Aren't you in a rush?

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:29.380
Be careful.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:30.260
Yes.

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.760
I'm really sorry!

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.940
Sorry, Enith. Couldn't help it.

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:51.450
I have the night shift today,
so I'll be back in the morning.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:54.520
Be sure to eat and get some energy back.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:07:59.740
Okay.

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:05.250
Enith.

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:05.790
Hm?

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:07.970
Be careful.

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:11.630
Yeah. I'm off.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:38.870
Damn. There's no point in rehabilitation.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.240
Why me?

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:45.880
My legs were a national treasure.

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:51.760
There are tons of other people that
could have gone without their legs!

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:56.640
Dammit. Dammit!

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:02.430
Then, you should just run again.

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:08.690
You should run again with those legs.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:11.850
What the? Who's there?!

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:15.720
I'm something that can grant your wish.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:21.460
If you accept me, you'll be able to run.
Like you did in the past...

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:45.580
Have I gone crazy?

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:52.070
I can give you the power to run again.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:55.940
Shit! What the hell! Stop!

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:59.240
Are you all right staying that way?

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:00.820
So noisy! Shut up!

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:04.830
You'll never run again.

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.520
Of course I want to run!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.590
Then, accept me.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:22.180
Give it a try! I'll take you on!
Make it so I can run again!

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:08.640
Let's grab another drink.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:11.350
What? But after another is always...

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.280
I can run.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:21.990
I can run!

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:24.990
What the heck is up
with that guy? So creepy!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:27.740
It's been a while since I last ran.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:29.450
Let's just hurry up and go.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:32.070
Huh?

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.590
That guy, wasn't he in the Olympics?

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:41.680
I hadn't run in a long time.
It's made me really hungry...

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:49.180
He turned back! Did he notice me?

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:09.480
What is this guy doing?

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:23.090
This feels amazing!

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:49.100
You don't need it?

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:52.200
Welcome! What would
you like to order?

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.460
Another of the same.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:55.790
--Huh?
--Okay!

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.920
Wait! I haven't ordered anything...

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:59.550
You have that.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.380
Thanks for waiting!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:02.090
So fast!

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:03.970
Today's special.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:05.970
As I thought.

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:08.300
I chased after him last night, myself.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.520
But you lost him part-way.

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:13.520
Right.

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:17.870
He's able to move around
at an incredible speed.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:21.270
But I couldn't find any
meaning in his movements.

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:24.490
There's no point in trying
to understand how a Horror thinks.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:27.070
This one looks like trouble.

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.650
Please take your time!

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:14.080
Excuse me.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:16.780
I'm looking for someone.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:19.950
He suddenly disappeared last night

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:21.790
This is him.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:31.180
Hey, now. That was kinda childish of you.

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:38.520
The only thing left in
the room was his wheelchair.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:41.350
There have been a lot of
kidnappings around here lately, too.

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:44.610
And, he was pretty famous
a few years ago.

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:46.190
Famous?

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:48.860
He was a gold medalist
in the quick sprint.

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:50.900
But...

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:56.080
Why did you keep such an
important thing a secret from me?!

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.660
I didn't want to worry you unnecessarily.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:02.250
Unnecessarily?! Let me worry with you!

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:06.140
I've always been here,
waiting to be your pillar...

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:12.430
Sorry. I'll definitely tell you
the next time I'm hurt.

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:14.020
Next time you're hurt?!

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:16.110
I'm sick of this!

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:17.720
Enith!

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:30.950
Watch out!

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:40.750
This is terrible! Someone got
caught under the signboard!

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:42.250
Someone call an ambulance!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:50.260
He's been going through
rehab so he can run again...

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:54.760
Got it. I'll contact you if we see him.

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.180
Please do.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:00.360
But, you know. This is kinda
hard for me to mention, but...

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:04.400
Like you said, this town has a lot of crime.

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:07.520
You should prepare yourself
for the worst, just in case.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:13.990
Thanks for listening to me.

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.240
Yeah.

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:17.010
Well, I'll take my leave now.

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:23.340
A ex-sprinter that can't
walk disappeared, huh?

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:28.000
It's worth leaving things
to me sometimes, right?

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.530
If you find the Horror,
lead him to this slum.

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:32.970
Huh? Why?

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:35.430
I can't leave things to you.

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:42.640
He's definitely making
things more complicated.

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:46.720
Crazy people tend to gather
around other crazy people.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:49.440
Including you, for sure.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:10.920
Enith.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:13.190
Huh?

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:18.430
Hardy!

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:24.140
I was worried since you weren't here.

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:28.780
I'm the one who was worried!
I'm glad you safe!

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:37.570
I was able to run again.

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:39.660
How?

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:45.620
I'm so hungry after moving
my body so much. Unbearably hungry.

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:49.460
No matter how much
I eat, I'm still hungry.

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:53.260
No matter how much I eat...

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:54.300
Hardy?

00:17:54.300 --> 00:18:01.100
I'm so hungry. So hungry.
I'm so freaking hungry!

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:22.700
Zaruba!

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:01.800
So damn fast!
I can't even catch him to fight!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.740
Should we corner him?

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:05.450
We got no choice!

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:14.040
Now!

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:17.780
Excuse me, I'm looking for someone.

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:20.130
This is him.

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:21.010
I haven't seen him.

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:21.910
Nope.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:23.920
Aren't her eyes all puffy from crying?

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:25.430
Don't say things like that.

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:26.970
But, I feel sorry for her.

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:29.720
Now, it's just up to how she'll deal with it.

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:34.980
Thanks for waiting.

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:37.830
No, thank <i>you</i>!

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:41.360
Good job last night. This is from the boss.

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:44.320
Boss wanted me to tell you,
"Nice combination!"

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:48.280
According to Zaruba,
we're a pair of crazy people.

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:52.540
In the East they say, "Like draws to like."

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:53.650
Don't joke around.

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:56.080
A nice combo!

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:57.290
Stop...

00:21:57.290 --> 00:22:01.630
I don't really mind. I know you're
just making things complicated.

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:05.130
This is really good!

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:07.050
Thank you very much!

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:08.800
You should hurry up and try it!

00:22:12.180 --> 00:22:15.020
Hm? What? Not gonna eat?

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:18.440
These two are no good, after all.

00:22:31.370 --> 00:22:41.420
<i>When I close my eyes I feel</i>
<i>gentle</i> <i>arms</i> <i>around</i> <i>me</i>

00:22:41.420 --> 00:22:45.880
<i>Warmth and memory</i>

00:22:45.880 --> 00:22:50.260
<i>SIGHT I can feel it now</i>

00:22:50.260 --> 00:22:54.560
<i>Without even saying goodbye</i>

00:22:54.560 --> 00:23:03.150
<i>We've chosen different</i> <i>paths</i>
<i>without</i> <i>realizing</i> <i>it</i>

00:23:03.150 --> 00:23:10.780
<i>Forced forward at the mercy of fate</i>

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:12.700
<i>When I'm sad</i>

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:28.630
<i>I keep thinking of your</i>
<i>sweet</i> <i>smile</i> <i>as</i> <i>I</i> <i>look</i> <i>up</i> <i>at the sky</i>

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:33.180
<i>I want to protect you</i>

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:41.400
<i>I will become strong and keep walking </i>

00:23:41.400 --> 00:23:48.520
<i>That's how I will live for another</i>
